hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"477","Abd al-Wahhab ibn Najdah ne hum se bayan kiya, aur Abu al-Mughirah ne, dono ne kaha: Safwan ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Rashid ibn Sa'd se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi apne bhai ko pukare aur wo us se kahe: Labbaik to wo ye na kahe: Aap ke samne, balke ye kahe: Allah tumhein tumhari pasand ke mutabiq jawab de."
